{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手衛蘭（Janice）於紅館舉行共4場《OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會》香港站，昨晚（14日）舉行頭場，是次巡迴演唱會不僅是衛蘭出道20周年的重要里程碑，更是她首度以「獨立音樂人」姿態登上紅館的旗艦級個唱，故別具意義。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:15:52.293341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:39.386903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:39.386903+00:00","content_hash":"feb1f5688c12bea673dd2a947977524a649c9590435c37be722b902136e0da94","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}